              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ediini eshemeire, etaine kamogo omu maisho ga Ruhanga Isheboona niyo egi: okutaayaayira efuuzi n'abafaakazi omu busaasi bwabo, n'okwerinda okugira amabara g'ensi.",
